; pw-a-fix1177-01 - expression matrix: context pw, value set A, 4 cells
; fixed cells of #1177 (a comparison is computed in the type so far of
; its context, not with its operands' own values): the checks have the
; port's values, the original's are the declared deviations of the test
; generated by exprmatrix expect from
; tests/corpus/tests-exprmatrix/matrix.txt (tools/exprmatrix/README.md);
; do not edit
DEFTYPE .w gw
Statement pw{x.w}
  SHARED gw
  gw=x
End Statement
!TestCase{cells}
  vl.l=100000 : vq.q=1.5
  pw{vq < vl} : !CheckEq{gw,-1,"pw-lt-q-l-A"}
  pw{vq <= vl} : !CheckEq{gw,-1,"pw-le-q-l-A"}
  pw{vq > vl} : !CheckEq{gw,0,"pw-gt-q-l-A"}
  pw{vq >= vl} : !CheckEq{gw,0,"pw-ge-q-l-A"}
!EndTestCase
